cygnet-provider (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=high

  * Wire the four CYGNET MAC algorithms into the provider build and dispatch.
    In 0.1.1 cygnetprov_mac.c was absent from the CMake source list, the
    cygnet_mac_algorithms symbol had no extern declaration, and
    query_operation had no OSSL_OP_MAC case, so CYGNET-HMAC, CYGNET-CMAC,
    CYGNET-KMAC-128, and CYGNET-KMAC-256 were unreachable at runtime.
  * Correct the provider-reported version string, which read 0.1.0 in the
    0.1.1 release.

 -- Sanctum SecOps LLC <support@sanctumsecops.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 19:41:00 +0000

